{"data": [{"id": "18337016164266872", "caption": "5 things that can\u2028make your credit score HEALTHY\nYou\u2019re probably missing one.\n\nSWIPE \u2192\n\nPAY ON TIME\nYour payment history matters.\nOne missed payment can sting.\n\nWATCH YOUR LIMIT\n$900 / $1,000 = \ud83d\udea9\n\nKEEP IT LOW\n$300 / $1,000 = \ud83d\udc40\nSame card. Very different signal.\n\nDON\u2019T CARRY DEBT\nYou don\u2019t need to pay interest\u2028just to build credit.\nYep. Really.\n\nUSE IT.\nSmall purchases.\u2028Low balance.\u2028On-time payments.\n\nCredit isn\u2019t about avoiding cards.\nIt\u2019s about using them right.\n\ud83d\udc47 DM \u201cCREDIT\u201d", "media_type": "CAROUSEL_ALBUM", "media_url": "https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/770387844_17972174814086484_3596610535863595371_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=x8Oen5LRYQsQ7kNvwH0KvNR&_nc_oc=AdqvMwyWWSw2FjS7Q7g1SiLDxBvoQIwPfuJ0p4Aa9xE1NcsZvy1oV1KwPLIaufxayAA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=y1eIq10xtWkn5B89F2me6A&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJBv7CnDVnPcvx9VKySMZVOnlINrCmvJgdnbE3CkmfAHS8uVYTTgelmjz9nn6JBEpnx_vKRfVUq&oh=00_AQHNYK4JoIhrGmA_NZp4yu4hP0ZcPR_YkZ7qhx7msX2CkA&oe=6A7FA50C", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Db3ElpzlQ4q/", "timestamp": "2026-08-10T13:00:02+0000", "local_thumb": "instagram-media/18337016164266872.jpg"}, {"id": "18374103865236413", "caption": "Well spent Sunday! Finals. \ud83c\udfcf  PEI VS NS \n\nWho is going to win the tournament?\n\n@novascotiacricketassociation @cricketpei", "media_type": "CAROUSEL_ALBUM", "media_url": "https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/769703371_17972341218086484_8760152194989382558_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=wpUOk7wQlfwQ7kNvwHkzyHp&_nc_oc=Adpib3qM22xoTcj9KvSxEMGAOTV8RwQis8kTvBwHgSiWehA0A7HN3lchoJoVUv-7SiA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=y1eIq10xtWkn5B89F2me6A&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJQbgop4MPjkjiXQS90GIwE3CC4fXFVIV9XFBCrdNhobMxvJeCpBGwz79eDIAnX-XNpfyUC5CQh&oh=00_AQHsKhMoc8TvOlWeklf2o_1Y-S_pLFNMRt6Jug3O_wbSpg&oe=6A7FB167", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Db1U6ZWlXS3/", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T20:44:49+0000", "local_thumb": "instagram-media/18374103865236413.jpg"}, {"id": "17895841926580933", "caption": "DOUBLE DIPPING IN REAL ESTATE? \ud83d\udc40\n\nWhat happens when the listing agent also brings the buyer?\n\nOne agent. Both sides of the deal.\n\nOn a $500K home with a 5% total commission, that\u2019s $25,000 in commission before brokerage splits, expenses, taxes, etc.\n\nBut here\u2019s the question:\n\nShould one agent really get paid for both sides? \ud83e\udd14\n\nThat\u2019s exactly what I break down in this video.\n\nKnow how the commission works before you sign.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Follow for more real estate money talk.\n\ud83d\udce9 DM me \u201cREAL ESTATE\u201d if you want to know what to ask before listing your home.", "media_type": "VIDEO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Db1P2VwhhR9/", "thumbnail_url": "https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/771652145_17972307786086484_4953373396043101847_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ARmGhWIGTqMQ7kNvwFWY_MT&_nc_oc=Ado74GdxgIwuLDTOAwmIckMh93COfnF59JQqpp6wbe2N139x2kw4358_g5OOx-KVdN8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=y1eIq10xtWkn5B89F2me6A&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIRIQKICsSrOWo6fNboAQEY_l_7Y1Vd5DrQdJEDL3go61NaozpC4TW_LVgeupsuXOGyoj2E3Q5_&oh=00_AQHXhZKTS3QEXYJBMjFgkfp7V6SSdacB5R1noAPF3ulvpA&oe=6A7FC0DE", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T20:00:04+0000", "local_thumb": "instagram-media/17895841926580933.jpg"}, {"id": "18106230428127123", "caption": "REAL ESTATE COMMISSION: 6%\u2026 STILL? \ud83d\udc40\nEPISODE 3\n\n6% used to be the norm.\nNow 5% is more common but some agents still charge 6%.\n\n$500K home = $5,000 difference.\n\nSo before you list, ask one simple question:\n\n\u201cWhat\u2019s your commission?\u201d\n\nKnow what you\u2019re paying. Then negotiate. \ud83d\udd25\n\nFollow for Episode 4 & more real estate money talk.", "media_type": "VIDEO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Db0ltxgRSWQ/", "thumbnail_url": "https://scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/769804150_17972308080086484_6437557297087985845_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=UaGv5VWgf_gQ7kNvwGMSHuz&_nc_oc=Adqw5a-0ngHwflDkPeopvzTi8UrBavBkHMjrNDsB41bg2CxYHDg6GfchvOgygzGylCc&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=y1eIq10xtWkn5B89F2me6A&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLwKGOKnUoSLIW2y0EQnJbos2ZvSaXG9tbUXsiWxHRVHNoVyQte4imsDR8cjRsMo0CszDvp5co-&oh=00_AQEX3zhliaPFU3g4xSLUZTUvfjNQfvXyv23-1WRL-vu7ug&oe=6A7FA224", "timestamp": "2026-08-09T13:54:13+0000", "local_thumb": "instagram-media/18106230428127123.jpg"}]}